msgstr "固定等待時間（如上）"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:100 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:601
msgid "Percentage complete"
msgstr "完成百分比"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:102 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:598
msgid "How the tracker decides an episode counts as watched: after the fixed wait above, or once playback reaches a percentage of the episode's actual duration. The latter needs the player to report its length over MPRIS, so it only applies when Tracker type is MPRIS."
msgstr "追蹤器判斷一集是否已觀看的方式：於上述固定等待時間之後，或達到該集實際長度的某個百分比時。後者需要播放器透過 MPRIS 回報長度，因此僅當追蹤器類型為 MPRIS 時適用。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:120
msgid "Plex and Kodi normally estimate when an episode is \"watched\" from playback position instead of a fixed timer. Enable this to make the currently selected one (Plex or Kodi) use the fixed \"Wait before updating\" time above instead. Has no effect for other tracker types."
msgstr "Plex 與 Kodi 通常根據播放位置而非固定計時器來估計一集是否「已觀看」。啟用此項可讓目前選取的一方（Plex 或 Kodi）改用上面的「更新前等待」時間。對其他追蹤器類型沒有影響。"

