msgstr "啟動時重新掃描媒體庫"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:311
msgid "Scan through whole list"
msgstr "掃描整個清單"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:315
msgid "Take subdirectory name into account"
msgstr "考慮子目錄名稱"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:330
msgid "Autoretrieve"
msgstr "自動取得"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:332 hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:349
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已停用"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:333
msgid "Always at start"
msgstr "啟動時一律"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:334
msgid "After n days"
msgstr "n 天後"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:347
msgid "Autosend"
msgstr "自動傳送"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:350
msgid "Immediately after every change"
msgstr "每次變更後立即"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:351
msgid "After n minutes"
msgstr "n 分鐘後"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:355
msgid "After the queue reaches n items"
msgstr "佇列達到 n 項後"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:359
msgid "At exit"
msgstr "結束時"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:372 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:1499
msgid "Additional options"
msgstr "其他選項"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:374
msgid "Change status automatically"
msgstr "自動變更狀態"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:376 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:1522
msgid "Moves a show to its start status (e.g. Watching) when you set episode 1, and to its finish status (e.g. Completed) when you set its last episode."
msgstr "設定第 1 集時，將作品移至開始狀態（如觀看中）；設定最後一集時，移至完成狀態（如已完成）。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:381
msgid "Change status automatically only if scored"
msgstr "僅在有評分時自動變更狀態"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:383 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:1538
msgid "Only applies to the finish-status change above: hold off moving the show to its finish status until it has a score, instead of doing it as soon as the last episode is set."
msgstr "僅適用於上面的完成狀態變更：在有評分之前，先不將作品移至完成狀態，而不是在設定最後一集後立即執行。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:387
msgid "Change start and finish dates automatically"
msgstr "自動變更開始與完成日期"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:406 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2232
msgid "Adding shows"
msgstr "新增作品"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:410 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2266
msgid "Currently active tab"
msgstr "目前使用中的標籤頁"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:412 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2267
msgid "Plan to Watch"
msgstr "計畫觀看"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:415 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2252
msgid "Default status when adding a show:"
msgstr "新增作品時的預設狀態："

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:421 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2300
msgid "Apply behavior"
msgstr "套用行為"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:424 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2311
msgid "Push a sync when applying settings"
msgstr "套用設定時推送同步"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:426
msgid "Sends any queued changes to the API right after you click Apply/OK here, instead of waiting for the next scheduled or manual sync. This only pushes -- it doesn't also pull a fresh copy of the list from the API."
msgstr "按一下此處的套用/確定後立即將所有排入佇列的變更傳送到 API，而不等待下一次排程或手動同步。這只會推送——不會同時從 API 拉取最新的清單。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:440 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2353
msgid "Enable multi-sync (BETA)"
msgstr "啟用多方同步（測試版）"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:442 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2359
msgid "BETA: Sync will now multi-sync across every configured provider by default, reconciling them with your local list instead of just uploading/downloading one account. Turn this off to fall back to the classic single-account sync."
msgstr "測試版：同步現在預設會與所有已設定的提供方進行多方同步，將它們與本機清單協調，而不只是上傳/下載單一帳戶。關閉此項可回到傳統的單帳戶同步。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:448 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2369
msgid "Always review changes before syncing"
msgstr "同步前一律先檢查變更"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:450 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2375
msgid "Sync fetches every provider and works out what would change per each field's sync rule, then always opens the sync window so you can review and sync it yourself. Turn this off to let Sync carry out clean changes headlessly -- decisions and new-entry adds still always stop for review either way."
msgstr "同步會取得每個提供方，並依各欄位的同步規則計算出會發生的變更，然後一律開啟同步視窗供您檢閱並自行同步。關閉此項可讓同步以無人值守方式執行簡單變更——但需要判斷的變更與新項目仍會一律停下等待您檢閱。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:457 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2385
msgid "Edit owned scores in the owner's rating system"
msgstr "以擁有者的評分系統編輯其所擁有的評分"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:459
msgid "When a show's Score is owned by another tracker, let the sidebar score editor rate it in that owner's own system (e.g. AniList's 8.4 while signed into Kitsu), toggled live via the Synced/Platform switch under the slider. Turn this off to always edit in the signed-in account's own system."
msgstr "當作品的評分由其他追蹤器擁有時，允許側邊欄評分編輯器以擁有者自己的系統評分（例如登入 Kitsu 時使用 AniList 的 8.4 分），透過滑桿下方的 同步/平台 開關即時切換。關閉此項將一律以已登入帳戶自己的系統編輯。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:477
msgid "Taiga Mode"
msgstr "Taiga 模式"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:480
msgid "Emulate Taiga's look (Qt only, requires restart)"
msgstr "模擬 Taiga 的外觀（僅 Qt，需要重新啟動）"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:488 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2416
msgid "Kitsu"
msgstr "Kitsu"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:491 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2451
msgid "Legacy (REST)"
msgstr "舊版（REST）"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:492 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2452
msgid "New (GraphQL)"
msgstr "新版（GraphQL）"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:494 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2438
msgid "Which Kitsu API to use for Kitsu accounts. Takes effect the next time the account is loaded. Both use the same Kitsu login."
msgstr "Kitsu 帳戶要使用哪個 Kitsu API。將於下次載入帳戶時生效。兩者使用相同的 Kitsu 登入資訊。"

