#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:539
msgid "Window"
msgstr "視窗"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:541
msgid "Remember window size and position"
msgstr "記住視窗大小與位置"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:542
msgid "Remember column layouts and widths"
msgstr "記住欄位配置與寬度"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:544
msgid "Use different visible columns per API"
msgstr "為每個 API 使用不同的可見欄位"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:546
msgid "Remember visible columns (and, if \"Remember column layouts and widths\" above is also on, their widths/order) separately for each API/account, instead of sharing one column layout across all of them."
msgstr "記住可見欄位（若上面的「記住欄位配置與寬度」也開啟，還會記住其寬度/順序），依每個 API/帳戶分別記住，而不是所有帳戶共用一個欄位配置。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:557 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:1586
