#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:568
msgid "When typing in the filter bar while on a specific status tab (e.g. Watching), automatically switch to the All tab so the filter searches your whole list instead of just that status."
msgstr "在特定狀態標籤頁（例如觀看中）的篩選欄中輸入時，自動切換到「全部」標籤頁，以便篩選整個清單而非僅該狀態。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:573
